// 15. Defensive Network Asset Discovery & Monitoring Engine (roze.sec.scan)
// ==============================================================================
// Sprint 17 (W35-W36) Deliverable: M9-T03
// Native Multi-Core Asynchronous Defensive Reconnaissance, Asset Inventory,
// Passive OS Fingerprinting, Service Identification & Structured Reporting
